# 22 - FizzBuzz
# Combined control flow: if/otherwise inside a repeat loop.

Let i be 1.

While i is less than or equal to 15
  If i modulo 3 is equal to 0 and i modulo 5 is equal to 0, then
    Print "FizzBuzz".
  Otherwise
    If i modulo 3 is equal to 0, then
      Print "Fizz".
    Otherwise
      If i modulo 5 is equal to 0, then
        Print "Buzz".
      Otherwise
        Print i.
      End.
    End.
  End.
  Set i to i plus 1.
End.